{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-ak3-13w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn AK3 13W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the Uwell Caliburn AK3 13W Pod System, featuring a 520mAh battery, 1.0ohm resistance, and operates off a draw and button activated firing mechanism. Constructed from durable aluminum, the Caliburn AK3 Pod System offers a slim and portable form factor and is easy to carry around in the pocket, purse, or bookbag. In addition, the Caliburn AK3 Pod System is capable of utilizing pods from the A3 Pod Series, holding up to 2mL within the confines of the refillable PCTG Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Caliburn AK3 13W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 67.5mm by 44.1mm by 12mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 520mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Range: 13W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 1.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Aluminum-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Dual-Activation - Button \u0026amp; Draw\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Series: Caliburn A3 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Top Fill - Mouthpiece Cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Material: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Installation: Press-Fit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn AK3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 1.0ohm Caliburn A3 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Silicone Lanyard\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531659943991,"sku":"U Caliburn AK3 Pod System","price":4100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_